X-WR-CALNAME:Windrush line disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-29T03:30:00&endDate=2026-09-01T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWINDRUSH LINE: Saturday 29\, Sunday 30 and Monday 31 August\, no service between Surrey Quays and Clapham Junction / Battersea Park. Replacement bus service M operates between Canada Water and Clapham Junction via Surrey Quays\, Queens Road Peckham\, Peckham Rye\, Denmark Hill\, Clapham High Street and Wandsworth Road. There will also be no SOUTHERN services at Queens Road Peckham and Peckham Rye\, with an additional replacement bus service between London Bridge and Tulse Hill. SOUTHEASTERN and THAMESLINK trains continue to serve Peckham Rye and Denmark Hill.
DTEND:20260901T002900Z
